    unknown={AccountID:usaa Available:false Threshold:500 Crossing:0001-01-01 Minimum:0 SuggestedTopUp:0 HasReference:false}
    genuine-zero={AccountID:usaa Available:true Threshold:500 Crossing:2026-08-16 Minimum:0 SuggestedTopUp:500 HasReference:false}

A genuine zero balance yields `Available:true` with a real crossing and a $500
top-up; an unknown balance yields `Available:false` with everything zeroed and
