**6. Suggested top-up — THE ITEM UNDER REVIEW. Fixed.**

    projection.go:235-240
    func roundUpToHundred(x float64) float64 {
        if x < floatTolerance {
            return 0
        }
        return math.Ceil(x/100-floatTolerance) * 100
    }

Exact boundary now returns $100 for cent-valued fixtures (both brief fixtures by
name, plus 800.60/800.10/800.90, plus the full 0..99 cent sweep, plus the
weekly-accumulation sweep — all PASS in-tree, all FAIL pre-fix). Genuinely-past
boundary still rounds up: $100.01 -> $200, verified in-tree and across my own
100/100 sweep. Both directions hold. See the two sections above for the
measured evidence.

**7. Account isolation.** Two halves, both checked.

Recurring items: `recurringBelongsToAccount` (projection.go:176-183) filters by
