  - odd: `TestProject_ReferenceMedianOddCount` (1000/2000/3000 -> 2000)
  - even: `TestProject_ReferenceMedianEvenCount` (1000/2000/2500/3000 -> 2250)
  - none: `TestProject_ReferenceNoPriorTransfers` -> `HasReference == false` and
